### Environment Variables
# @token = <insert_jwt_token_here>

### Get Current User Profile
GET http://localhost:8091/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update User Profile
PATCH http://localhost:8091/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Name",
  "bio": "Updated bio here",
  "phone": "+94 77 123 4567"
}

### Request Verification
POST http://localhost:8091/api/users/me/verification
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "dealer"
}

### Delete Account
DELETE http://localhost:8091/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
